        "edit": "Replace the duplicated case item 3'd6 with 3'd7 (mapping ABC=7 to X=1,Y=0) and change the default branch's blocking assignment Y=0 to nonblocking Y<=0, so the output at cycle7 matches the expected 01 instead of 00.",
